    {
      "text": "Glad we finally got a word too from $NVDA Jensen Huang today from an event at Stockholm...\n\nAbout $CRWV amid the broader Neocloud selloff. \n\nWhen asked about the markets reactions to Coreweave, Jensen responded: \n\n- \"Coreweave's strength is improving every day, I'm optimistic\"\n- \"The cost of capital is actually decreasing\"\n\nOn whether Nvidia needed to provide a financial backstop:\n\n- Jensen said he did not see a need for Nvidia to backstop CoreWeave\n\nI'm personally not too positive about $CRWV relative to $NBIS and the others... but any copium helps from the man himself with market sentiment.",
      "url": "https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2110848740559126575",
