    {
      "text": "I mean it's probably more important to look at the actions over words... I'm sure $GOOGL trying to secure supply until 2035, would spark other hyperscalers to follow suit as well. \n\nThey probably wouldn't be going 9 years out if they thought there would be overflooding in supply from China in 2 years.",
