    {
      "text": "Nobody said $SIVE was going to be the sole laser provider for Ayar for all generations. 2nd gen Supernova was 16x wavelength that they confirmed Sivers.\n\nAyar is expected to do multi-vendor for lasers, would be stupid not to. Originally disclosed suppliers were $LITE, $MTSI, and $SIVE, but there's probably only a few companies that can do this new design. \n\nFor their new demonstration at OCP it's 8x 200mW range, $LITE is probably the closest one technologically to Ayar's OCP announcement, with 8x 250 mW demonstrated at ECOC just last month that they're targeting availability later in 2027. \n\nI",
      "url": "https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2110835574458442200",
      "time": "Thu Oct 15 20:49:53 +0000 2026",
      "cashtags": [
        "LITE",
